        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lagheanga baragi sing'waar deaba iyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Sina laghean iyeenya baragi uurji giika bea madeedean, ak gaydang'oorsa badaydeaba lagheang'su ng'asheega uurji giiga bea lagheanga madeeda ghayi inyarjeawayiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woosa hidaat sakteayda, ak gidiyeani hini uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi sakteayda, ak ginyasanaan uhuuda giijeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gidiyeani nea giideani sih, ak ea adeadeaksi sih badayda giijeeda, ghana nooga ghana dugwa siihaaghwa aba geeshta giijeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Musa lagheanga baragi iyeenya uurji giika ghayi bea mwadiin, ak gabean ghang'eat nea gudea sakteayda duw gil ak gwadiyeada gawa uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA niny, nea ghwaada geadi lagheanga baragi iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwararang'aana NG'UTAMIIDA jeedeaba shamooghoodida ak ghamiinaada aba murdeeda Musa aba hoowa, ak gwarukuta gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'ata NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeadaanyi, ak gwarukwiida nea gwayi, “NG'UTAMIIDA, NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA mideawa baydeayda haw ea alooheeda, nyarastaanyi maygabean ghwanyareas, mideawa baydeayda haw ea bariinyeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dea bayiida fih sagalamnyooji sagalama, nea gwasamsa munyinda ea giidiinyeanyeeka ea riing'eeda, ak ea maygwayiitiisa siida munyinda ghwanung' gawuurji gili mandeawana giidiinyeanda, ak giidiinyeanyeeka ghweaniga nyaawa gayghwayiin badahuuka diibiga ea gea diibiga nyaawa ghang'eada jeateaba samwagu ea ghoah jeateaba ang'wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabuy Musa uhuudaanyi aba geeshangiga ak ghaghadoawan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi, “Iinaanyaschi dagheerjeanduumeeda aba madeadaang'u, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, geamuscheey NG'UTAMIIDA, una bugusteanya, aba gideaba fiisu eahang'oonyi iheeni, ak gisamsi munyindeanya ea riing'eegaasa, ak ginung' eehearaneeyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geebiikta eesin neajeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, geasinyi neajeeda. Aba madeeda fugaagu sean, gaydasin ng'asheega deamdeameadi dea ghayi miyeesin aba badayda ng'eanyiisean ghana aba jeeda eemoojiga, ak fuga sean indi bugusta gayghwadaah gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba gaygaba muuwda gichea dasimaneey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula ng'asheanji earukuneey ghamneawean. Ng'ula, gaydahoan dearuuta aba madeadaang'u fuga Amori, ea Ganaani, Hiti, ea Berisi, ea Hafiti ea Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shageada geaw, adiidu gisini neajeeda sea fugeaba ng'eanyiita iweesiin, adagawuurji ghuduumbwaada aba jeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaynyarjeaweada heeda wagiida nyaawa, nea gihirjeaweadi daranajeega nyaawa, nea gilaksi ng'eanyi geediga sigadoowani bea aseecheeka siguura Asherimu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(ak ea maybwada aseeta nuut, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was gheawungaaschi shidoodeaba ghaang' niny ASEETA shit ghaang' gil), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adiidu gisini neajeeda sea fugeaba ng'eanyiita, ak gaweay gwasin hiseadayeanduumeeda sea aseecheeka nyaawa, nea ghoadaw aseecheeka nyaawa lukghumeeda ak gaguurneey akaleala aba jeenyaawa ak giyaagi hamita siitaw aseecheeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghaghi orjoagaagu haweega nyaawa, ak gaweay haweega nyaawa gwahiseada sea aseecheeka nyaawa, ak gayghwanung' gaweay orjoagaagu gwahiseada sea aseecheeka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adisissi geaw aseecheeka dahaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gayghamwada ghweelmeeda mukaateeyda meamwaatawiida. Gajaga mukaateeyda meamwatawiida eawooji ispwa, gawuurji gidearukuteaydi nea geenda geashu damanda ghayi oorini Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duweachajeega sean geasu gil, gea was heewgaagu sean bea dugwa ea nooga was duweachajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duweacheeda digeeda gajatinana dayeenda gisilleanda, ghana iimajatina abeeda gayhirja gheata. Ak duweachajeega orjoagaagu gajatina. Ak ea manda siida jea ghwahidu madeedeanyu nea gweadu geatinga ghajaam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaygadiyeena eawooji lah, ak eaweedeaba ispwa gayfuufa, damanda barooda ea damanda lajooda booga gayfuufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghamwada ghweelmoojiga wiikajeega, bea haghweega madeeda bea lajita ngaano, ea ghweelmeeda giimughuushta haleanjeeda muudeanooda gweayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda gweayda headigaagu gaygaweay niba samwagu madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaydahoan dearuuta eemoojiga aba madeadaang'u, nea geaheedu moonghoadaang'u; ak ea manda siida jea gagasa ng'eanyiidaang'u, inyas gischeang'di una madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U niba samwagu aba jeeda gweayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adisabi geadi foojeanda lukghumeedeanyu sea mukaateeyda simwatawiit, ghana lukghumeeda ghweelmeeda Basaaka adagoobiida heeda ea ghoah sakteayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda madeeda was haghweega madeeda bea ng'eanyiidaang'u gajeani jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. Adiiwaali dayeenda mbooyda duu gwareer ghaamwat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
