          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Ng'oara ng'asheesu, aba gideaba aniini neasinyi neajeeda sea ang'iing'i sea fuga Israeli aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobiida hoowa sea NG'UTAMIIDA eawooji haradam askweari ea eawa, nea mwaaga mukaate nea mwali beega. Ak gang'oorsa badaydeaba lagheangiga baragiin ng'asheega neajeeda, was digheanyeeka atamanamughuush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa ghwararang'aada aba uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwararang'aan Musa aba uhuuda Giijeeda Sinayi, nea gwandeawa aba geatingaaschi lagheanga baragi asiyeenya sing'waar bea muuwuunooda damanda rarang'aana Musa uhuuda giijeeda abeeda mwanala gideaba mughoowooda gheamamdaanyi niyamwa gaweeshiit aba gideaba nibalool sea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadaah Haruni sea fuga sean bea Israeli Musa ging'ulayi niyamwa mughoowooda gheamamdaanyi ea gaweeshiit, ak geabeal ak ea mudeeneekiissa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa Musa saawa, ea Haruni ea fuga hees sean bea fuga bwat geat gabiigu headaanyi, ak gabalool Musa sea saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghapka fuga sean bea Israeli gwaneekiissa, ak ghoadaw saawa digheanyeeka sean abaloola NG'UTAMIIDA niny aba uhuuda Giijeeda Sinayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ahiit Musa baloolda sea saawa, gageanu gwarasa weasta gheamamdaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea inyeesa Musa iiweah madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gabalool sea niny gageanda weastida, ea eaghus gwarita jarooda, ak iirita jarooda, gwarukusa fuga Israeli ng'asheega sirukusa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwadaah fuga Israeli gheamamda Musa, nea muunda gheamamda Musa ea niweeshiit, ak gageanu Musa gwarasa weasta gheamamdaanyi gicha, ea eaghus gawa gea gabalool sea niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.35"
            ]
          }
        }
